				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>転送マシン　起動中！
しばらく　お待ちください</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
